      'Temperature 1.0 on agents — default temperature on most SDKs is 0.7–1.0. An agent with high temperature makes different routing decisions for identical inputs. Always set <code>temperature: 0</code> for agent decision-making.',
      'No observability wrapper — the agent service is a black box without instrumentation. Log every tool call with name/input-type/latency/status. Without this you are flying blind in production.',
      'PII in logs — an agent that processes customer data will have PII in its state, prompts, and tool results. Implement log sanitisation at the source — mask PII fields before writing.',
